# cancel: 200 with an empty body, the operation ends cancelled and may no longer be cancelled
> DELETE /api/v1/operations/<op2>?project=alpha
< 200 OK
< Content-Type: application/json
< Cache-Control: no-store
{
  "metadata": {},
  "status": "Success",
